# 28. Important Difference

### For Loop

```python
for i in range(5):
    print(i)
```

Best when the number of iterations or collection is known.

### While Loop

```python
i = 0

while i < 5:
    print(i)
    i += 1
```

Best when repetition depends on a condition.

